   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Talking about aspirations",
     "texto": [
      "**Cita-cita** is a goal or aspiration. **Menjadi** means \"to become\"; **tetapi** introduces an idea that contrasts with the previous one."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "How to achieve a goal",
     "texto": [
      "**Bagaimana cara meraih cita-cita?** asks how to achieve a goal. In English we say \"how can I…?\"; in Indonesian the expression **bagaimana cara + verb** is enough."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
